            "html": "<section data-stage=\"snih\" class=\"sec hero hero-sub\">\n<div class=\"hero-text\">\n<h1 class=\"h1 rise\">Osm kusů brokátu, 13 slov a styl Yang</h1>\n<p class=\"lead rise d1\">Cvičení, která vyučujeme.</p>\n\n<div class=\"actions rise d3\"><nav aria-label=\"Na této stránce\" class=\"actions\"><a href=\"#brokat\" class=\"more\">Osm kusů brokátu <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"arr\"><path d=\"M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"#slov\" class=\"more\">13 slov tchaj-ťi <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"arr\"><path d=\"M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"#yang\" class=\"more\">Tchaj-ťi stylu Yang <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"arr\"><path d=\"M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></a></nav></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</section>"
